	...
	ticks[nextTickToCross].feeGrowthOutside1 = feeGrowthGlobal - ticks[nextTickToCross].feeGrowthOutside1;
}
```

### Recommended Mitigation Steps

Switch the `0` and `1` in `Ticks.cross()`.

